# In-game pause menu without save/load (multiplayer): a 480 x 446 dialog centred on a 40% scrim, the game logo on top
# and the commands as a column of menu buttons, in the original order. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080.
scrim
window $QuitMenuParent centre middle 0 0 480 446 dialog
window $WinLogo left top 758 341 404 110
stack centre top 0 475 440 14
  item $ButtonOptions 52 menu
  item $ButtonRestart 52 menu
  item $ButtonExit 52 menu
  item $ButtonReturn 52 menu
end
